</invoke>
```json
{
  "issues": [
    "The client has no photos of the workshop, yet the hero uses a generic AI vineyard landscape that says nothing about the business; a typographic hero with facts suits a call-led business",
    "The homepage shows contact facts twice once the hero carries them; only one place is allowed",
    "The closing CTA copy asks to call but its only button is directions",
    "The about text describes the family in the third person instead of the business's own voice"
  ],
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/pages/0/sections/0",
      "value": {
        "id": "s_hero",
        "type": "hero-type",
        "variant": "with-facts",
        "tone": "default",
        "props": {
          "eyebrow": "Vulkanizerstvo v Ptuju",
          "headline": "Gume za vaš avto, kombi ali traktor",
          "intro": "Menjamo in centriramo gume, krpamo predrte in prodajamo nove. Spomladi in jeseni je gneča, zato se naročite po telefonu.",
          "primary": {
            "label": "Pokličite nas",
            "target": { "action": "call" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "path": "/pages/0/sections/1"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/pages/0/sections/4/props/paragraphs",
      "value": [
        "Smo družinska delavnica. Leta 1994 jo je odprl oče Stanko, danes jo vodi sin Matej Zorman.",
        "Najdete nas takoj za bencinsko črpalko na Ormoški cesti."
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/pages/0/sections/5/props/primary",
      "value": {
        "label": "Pokličite nas",
        "target": { "action": "call" }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/pages/0/sections/5/props/secondary",
      "value": {
        "label": "Navodila za pot",
        "target": { "action": "directions" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Note: after removing the contact strip at index 1, the about section is at index 3 and the CTA at index 4 (the steps section is at 4 → shifts to 3 for about). My last two patches use pre-removal indices and would hit the wrong sections, so here is the corrected list, in order:

